OL,5,G0230 Lily & Lolly: The Forgotten Yeats
OL,6,G     Sisters
OL,7,     FImelda May explores the legacy of
OL,8,     FSusan and Elizabeth Yeats, two
OL,9,     Fsisters who played a significant
OL,10,     Frole in the revival of Irish
OL,11,     Fliterature in the 1920s.
OL,12,G0400 My Week With Guerrilla Girls
OL,13,     FKate Bryan explores the lives of
OL,14,     Fthe Guerrilla Girls, a group of
OL,15,     Fart activists who haven't granted
OL,16,     Fa film crew full access to their
OL,17,     Flives and work in over 30 years.
